    "label": "Cash",
    "value": "cash"
  },
  "benefits": "\n- The scheme provides financial assistance for the Construction of the New Grow-out Ponds. The project cost is ₹7,00,000/- per Hectare.\n- The subsidy will be limited to 40% of the project cost for beneficiaries falling under the General Category.\n- The subsidy will be limited to 60% of the project cost for beneficiaries who are Scheduled Caste (SC) or Women.\n\n<br>\n\n",
