        "documentsRequired_md": "\n1. Agreement Deed between Beneficiary and Fisheries Department.\n1. Date of Birth Certificate (Voting Card/ Birth Certificate/ Aadhar Card/ Matriculation Certificate).\n1. Caste Certificate (from first-class Magistrate, Tehsildar).\n1. Training Certificate of Beneficiary.\n1. Land Record from Tehsil (Own Land-Jamabandi, Nakal Akshizra Farad) or Registered Lease Deed of Minimum 7 Years.\n1. Bills/Receipts/Vouchers.\n1. Photographs of Ponds/Nurseries/Aerators, etc. with Beneficiary.\n1. Details of Bank Account and PAN Card.\n1. Detailed Project Report (DPR)/Self-Contained Proposal (SCP) as per PMMSY guidelines.\n\n",
